{"title": "Frightened (status group)", "pageid": 22734, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Frightened_(status_group)", "categories": ["Status groups"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">This page is about the status group. For the condition, see <a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(Condition)\" title=\"Frightened (Condition)\">Frightened (Condition)</a>.</div>\n<p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/45px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Condition Type Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><b>Frightened</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Status_group\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status group\">status group</a>. <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(Condition)\" title=\"Frightened (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Frightened\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(Condition)\" title=\"Frightened (Condition)\">Frightened</a> is the representative condition for the type. Conditions that inflict Frightened generally have the following effects:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Cannot move.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ability Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Ability Checks</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Removal\"> Removal </span></h2>\n<p>The following spells/actions remove all conditions in this status group:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dispel_Evil_and_Good\" title=\"Dispel Evil and Good\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a5/Dispel_Evil_And_Good_Icon.webp/30px-Dispel_Evil_And_Good_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a5/Dispel_Evil_And_Good_Icon.webp/45px-Dispel_Evil_And_Good_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a5/Dispel_Evil_And_Good_Icon.webp/60px-Dispel_Evil_And_Good_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dispel Evil and Good\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a5/Dispel_Evil_And_Good_Icon.webp/30px-Dispel_Evil_And_Good_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a5/Dispel_Evil_And_Good_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Dispel_Evil_and_Good\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dispel Evil and Good\">Dispel Evil and Good</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stillness_of_Mind\" title=\"Stillness of Mind\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Stillness_of_Mind_Icon.webp/30px-Stillness_of_Mind_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Stillness_of_Mind_Icon.webp/45px-Stillness_of_Mind_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Stillness_of_Mind_Icon.webp/60px-Stillness_of_Mind_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stillness of Mind\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Stillness_of_Mind_Icon.webp/30px-Stillness_of_Mind_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/Stillness_of_Mind_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Stillness_of_Mind\" title=\"Stillness of Mind\">Stillness of Mind</a></span></li>\n</ul><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Immunity\"> Immunity </span></h2>\n<p>The following items grant immunity to all conditions in this status group:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cloth_of_Authority\" title=\"Cloth of Authority\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Cloth_of_Authority_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Cloth_of_Authority_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Cloth_of_Authority_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Cloth_of_Authority_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Cloth_of_Authority_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Cloth_of_Authority_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Cloth_of_Authority_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Cloth_of_Authority_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Cloth_of_Authority_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image li