p 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/Sarevok%27s_Horned_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Sarevok%27s_Horned_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/80/Sarevok%27s_Horned_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Sarevok%27s_Horned_Helmet\" title=\"Sarevok's Horned Helmet\">Sarevok's Horned Helmet</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>The following spells/actions grant immunity to all conditions in this status group:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aura_of_Courage\" title=\"Aura of Courage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Aura_of_Courage_Icon.webp/30px-Aura_of_Courage_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Aura_of_Courage_Icon.webp/45px-Aura_of_Courage_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Aura_of_Courage_Icon.webp/60px-Aura_of_Courage_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Aura of Courage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Aura_of_Courage_Icon.webp/30px-Aura_of_Courage_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/66/Aura_of_Courage_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Aura_of_Courage\" title=\"Aura of Courage\">Aura of Courage</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Calm_Emotions\" title=\"Calm Emotions\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d9/Calm_Emotions_Icon.webp/30px-Calm_Emotions_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d9/Calm_Emotions_Icon.webp/45px-Calm_Emotions_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/t